Juice of one lime&#xD;
&#xD;
Directions:
&#xD;
&#xD;
Add the meatball ingredients to a small mixing bowl and use your hands to mix until well combined. Next, use a cookie dough scoop or tablespoon to scoop out the pork mixture and form meatballs.&#xD;
