Spice up your look and style with the unique, vibrant shade of Liese Natural Series Milk Tea Brown Hair Color. It has a light mellow brown color for a sweet look. This product comes with a rinse-off treatment that repairs hair cuticle layers so you can achieve moisturized and manageable hair.
&#xD;
&#xD;
With creamy bubbles that will coat and color every hair strand effectively&#xD;
Thick foam fully coats hair for even color turnout&#xD;
Easy to apply on hair, even at the back and inner layers&#xD;
Non-drip bubble formula for less mess and staining&#xD;
With rinse-off treatment that repairs the hair cuticle layer&#xD;
&#xD;
Directions for Use: Read the instructions carefully before using and use as directed.
&#xD;
&#xD;
Before use, keep the product at room temperature (between 20&#xB0;C and 30&#xB0;C) for about one hour before mixing the solutions. If the formula is too cold or too warm, it will not foam easily.&#xD;
Pour Solution 1 into Solution 2, and gently turn it upside down a few times to mix.&#xD;
Squeeze the center of the bottle to dispense foam.&#xD;
Apply plenty of foam and massage until the texture of the foam becomes thick and creamy. Massage gently to avoid tangling hair.&#xD;
Leave foam on hair for about 20 to 30 minutes, then rinse out completely. Finish by shampooing and then apply the enclosed rinse-off treatment.&#xD;
&#xD;
Notes:
&#xD;
&#xD;
One box is enough to color shoulder-length hair. Two boxes may be needed for thicker and longer hair&#xD;
Not meant for gray or white hair coverage.&#xD;
Shades specifically made for Asian Hair to realize its beautiful color.&#xD;
Results will vary depending on the shade and lightness of the hair before coloring, the hair's condition, room temperature, and how long the mixture is left on.&#xD;
This product should not be used to lighten hair that has been dyed black by hair color or hair manicure.&#xD;
Using this product on hair that is strongly bleached or damaged may cause color results to vary or color to fade more quickly.&#xD;
&#xD;
Caution: Avoid letting the foam (mixture) and the rinsing water come in contact with the eyes.
&#xD;
Warning: Do not use the product while taking a bath. This product is not a shampoo.

