Dumplings are a traditional food in Asian cuisine, and the Korean version is called "mandoo." They are made with various ingredients wrapped in dough. Paldo Mandoo Hot &amp; Spicy Korean Dumpling is a beloved vegetable mandoo with a distinctly Korean taste.
&#xD;
