Keep out of reach of children and pets. Do not place it in an area where the unit may be susceptible to hard knocks. Do not operate with wet hands or metal objects. Do not obstruct or block airflow from the unit. Do not use in small, confined pet areas without adequate ventilation. Do not place near a source of heat or direct sunlight.&#xD;
