Cooking Directions:
&#xD;
&#xD;
Pan Fried - Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Add oil to coat pan. Place frozen dumplings onto the pan. Hent on medium-high heat for 7-8 minutes, turning each side every 2-5 minutes or until all side are. golden brown.&#xD;
Deep Fried - In hot oil (350F), deep fry frozen or thawed dumplings for 3-4 minutes or until all side are golden brown.&#xD;
